      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's good. Can you make it feel a bit more \"human\" though? The current version is a little stiff. Maybe add a small sentence or two that acknowledges how unpredictable logistics can be sometimes, just to make us sound a bit less like a corporate robot and more like we're actually acknowledging the chaos of shipping errors?",
